<description>&lt;p&gt;Boko Haram fighters have again struck a Cameroonian village, killing seven people, while government forces continue operations against Anglophone separatists in the Northwest and Southwest. A metal shark patrol boat has been delivered to Cameroon to boost maritime security against Boko Haram. An explosion at a steel plant killed four people and injured sixteen. Anti-femicide protests have occurred, reflecting broader social tensions. The conflict recorded 231 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;DW.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Stop Russian Recruiters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Social News XYZ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiygFBVV95cUxNQ1Nqa2lGQWZkV0tnU0ZqTHFkQ2pCbWxKV2NlNl9UaTIzU19qczdvN3Fvc2p2bG1XYXJxc2VTZnZlVnBBVzllZ1lBVTNtcVY2X2FKMVlrZ3VIWVhaMkZLaTJpYzFGRnpzVVRIWlNRZU5VVXBDZjNkMDJxQ25TNG5kOGdsRkNfSWJ0OFgxVFBDNWVINkY2ZWw3TUI1NHhiNlVOcGx1SDhrN255T3lHeXFTMDhEQWFvS3ZMeUdiSDAwdXBSU3NJdUZvd213?oc=5&quot;&gt;Genocide Watch&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxOTmlTWjdrMXNSWjBwUG5oUzl6cUhSNVZxSXNyekhJTnJnWFBjT2RIMXNuanJIUW03NXdIaWM2NGIyNTY4ZEF2TS1JdEFkU1hzTjZDZmU3YTd6Um5SOUFfMFZLM3ZHc1JlVVcxZHZvWDg3Q3FKOWZQX1RxZmxKa2k2WGFLTm9GVlA2SnJDaDBHZ2h6RXNqNC0tYTEybTRBblo1UklhUzlpT0w2bVhDZ05Xanl5Z0g5TFQ0Q2x3Ug?oc=5&quot;&gt;THISDAYLIVE&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqAFBVV95cUxNXzZLMTRMVTB1TEVLdDB6ek1FQ3cxSnVZdm4wUE1pbDFpcWYwdnplLVVPa0tmMWFzS19fVzYzb3AteG8yQTU5MkpGNkNOY0p3eGh4TjlUWmtVeklqWUY2aWlzUi1oc3UtMjByeTJ2VDZ0b1IteVZTZmxvUkFiQ0NnVm5MY0RQU0IwY2ZhcUNiWjZ5NkxoUjdMNDE4SjJ5VGdYbHNneVN0R3Q?oc